@TemporalDemo.ApiService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5070

### 1. Health Check
GET {{TemporalDemo.ApiService_HostAddress}}/alive

### 2. Submit Order (Approved: Amount <= $1000)
POST {{TemporalDemo.ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerNumber": "CUST-001",
  "amount": 250.00
}

### 3. Submit Order (Declined: Amount > $1000)
POST {{TemporalDemo.ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerNumber": "CUST-002",
  "amount": 1500.00
}

### 4. Query Order Status (Use OrderId from POST response)
GET {{TemporalDemo.ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000